{
  // Placeholder animations. Edit and save while the game runs: changes apply instantly.
  //
  //   frames         how many frames (the label moves top → bottom across them)
  //   beatsPerFrame  beats each frame lasts (1 = one frame per beat, 0.5 = two per beat)
  //   loop           true = repeats; false = plays once, then holds its last frame
  //   clock          "music" keeps moving while paused (idles); "sim" freezes while paused (everything else)
  //
  // Choreography rule: each step in data/game/tuning.json has a fixed length, and step
  // clips should fill it exactly (frames x beatsPerFrame = the step's beats), so they end
  // on the beat. A shorter clip holds its last frame; a longer one gets cut off (the dev
  // panel's Run inspector lists both).
  //
  // Heroes:     Idle, Walk, EncounterEntrance, Ready, Fight / Disarm / Puzzle / Magic,
  //             Victory, VictoryReact, Death, DeathReact, PortalEntrance, PortalExit
  // Encounters: Idle, HeroEnter, Ready, Interact, Victory (a hero died), Defeat (a hero won)
